      "writtenOn": "2021-08-25T09:06:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this works. In the case where we\u0027re starting a VM, which is the fun case, the VM will be shut down again after running initialize, and so sign will never work.\nInstead can we just make the initialize call inside sign() ?\n(It already does one-off initialization before calling signFile one or more times.)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 503,
        "startChar": 40,
