        "id": 1042276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-25T14:30:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Couldn\u0027t we always initialize the VM / both VM instances?  Do you suggest to change the `sign` API back to take a key blob?  If we expect the key initialization to happen in the VM in the future, it seems better to not expose the key blob from the API.  WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "662c192e_8b989300",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 503,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 503,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "4891f4729ba0d6e89f46b4048ca2202c1f6fe317",
