      "writtenOn": "2021-08-25T14:47:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Couldn\u0027t we always initialize the VM / both VM instances? \nI\u0027m not against retaining \"compos_key_cmd initialize\", although I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s that useful - just that we need to be able to start the VM, initialize \u0026 sign all in one go.\n\n\u003e Do you suggest to change the `sign` API back to take a key blob? \nNo, definitely not. Just that \"compos_key_cmd sign\" should do initialize and then a bunch of signing. (Nit: that is what the usage documentation still says it does.)",
